<title>HONG KONG: Peregrine sets Hang Seng Bank warrants.</title>
<headline>Peregrine sets Hang Seng Bank warrants.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Peregrine Derivatives Ltd said on Friday it has launched 30 million American style call warrants on shares of Hang Seng Bank Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	 HK$112.80	  PREMIUM	 19.2 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	  HK$1.778	   GEARING	 6.2x</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	   19.JUN.98	  MIN EXER LOT  1,000</p>
<p> REFERENCE SPOT     HK$109.50	  PAY DATE	14.JUL.97</p>
<p> LISTING		HONG KONG	  LISTING DATE  16.JUL.97</p>
<p> NOTE		   PHYSICAL SHARES WITH CASH ALTERNATIVE AT</p>
<p>ISSUER'S DISCRETION</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370.  http://www.hk97.com</p>
</text>
